.TH "libnvmf_config_emit_new" 9 "libnvmf_config_emit_new" "October 2026" "libnvme API manual" LINUX
.SH NAME
libnvmf_config_emit_new \- Create a configuration emitter.
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B "struct libnvmf_config_emitter *" libnvmf_config_emit_new
.BI "(struct libnvme_global_ctx *ctx "  ");"
.SH ARGUMENTS
.IP "ctx" 12
libnvme global context. Must not be NULL.
.SH "RETURN"
A new emitter on success, or NULL on failure.
Free the emitter with \fBlibnvmf_config_emit_free\fP.
